<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Class <link linkend="_class_splash">Splash</link></para>

<para>This class represents a splash screen with a progress bar for the <link linkend="_namespace_bearsampp">Bearsampp</link> application. It provides methods to initialize the splash screen, set loading text, and increment the progress bar. </para>
